flowchart TD
    Q1{"Is there a need to store state?"}
    No1["Do not use Blockchain<br/>(State storage not required)"]
    Q2{"Are there multiple writers?"}
    No2["Do not use Blockchain<br/>(Use standard file / single DB)"]
    Q3{"Can an online Trusted Third Party<br/>(TTP) always be trusted?"}
    Yes3["Use Traditional Centralized RDBMS<br/>(e.g., PostgreSQL / Oracle)"]
    Q4{"Are all writers known?"}
    No4["Use Permissionless Public Blockchain<br/>(e.g., Bitcoin / Ethereum Mainnet)"]
    Q5{"Are all writers trusted?"}
    Yes5["Use Shared Distributed Database<br/>with trusted write consensus"]
    Q6{"Is public verifiability required?"}
    Yes6["NIRVAAN Architecture:<br/><b>Permissioned / Consortium Blockchain</b><br/>(Ethereum Sepolia / Hyperledger Besu)"]
    No6["Use Private Consortium Blockchain<br/>with restricted read permissions"]

    Q1 -->|No| No1
    Q1 -->|Yes| Q2
    Q2 -->|No| No2
    Q2 -->|Yes| Q3
    Q3 -->|Yes| Yes3
    Q3 -->|No| Q4
    Q4 -->|No| No4
    Q4 -->|Yes| Q5
    Q5 -->|Yes| Yes5
    Q5 -->|No| Q6
    Q6 -->|Yes| Yes6
    Q6 -->|No| No6

